   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">using UdsMessageConstPtr = <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::unique_ptr</a>&lt;const <a class=\"vis-internal\" href=\"../classes/cl_apext_diag_uds_transport_UdsMessage_a98d15.html\">UdsMessage</a>, <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::function</a>&lt;void(const <a class=\"vis-internal\" href=\"../classes/cl_apext_diag_uds_transport_UdsMessage_a98d15.html\">UdsMessage</a>*)&gt;&gt;;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This is the unique_ptr for constant UdsMessages containing a custom deleter as provided by the generic/core DM part towards the UdsTransportLayer-Plugin.</p></div>",
